<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="36668978"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1538273695"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Love Letter"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="CHiCO with HoneyWorks"/><amll:meta key="album" value="世界はiに満ちている"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:09.773"><div begin="00:00.848" end="04:47.524"><p begin="00:00.848" end="00:10.511" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">刻んでく僕たちの針を戻せるのなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果我们之间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki za n de ku bo ku ta chi no</span></p><p begin="00:11.966" end="00:24.373" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">下手くそな"ラブレター"風にのせもう一度届けよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让风载着那拙劣的情书</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">he ta ku so na ra bu re ta a</span></p><p begin="00:34.356" end="00:44.082" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">変わり行く街並みを歩いては立ち止まり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">走过渐渐改变的街道</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka wa ri i ku ma chi na mi wo a ru i te wa</span></p><p begin="00:45.482" end="00:55.397" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">どれだけの時が過ぎ流れていったのだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">究竟经过了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do re da ke no to ki ga</span></p><p begin="00:57.076" end="01:07.452" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">前を向くことにただ必死で互いの歩幅も忘れて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只顾拼命向前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma e wo mu ku ko to ni ta da hi 's shi de</span></p><p begin="01:08.247" end="01:19.012" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">進んだ先に残った足跡は僕ひとつだけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">路的尽头留下的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su su n da sa ki ni no ko 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:19.077" end="01:28.692" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">手を伸ばしても届かなくて霞んでゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使伸出手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te wo no ba shi te mo</span></p><p begin="01:28.778" end="01:29.660" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">ねえ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne e</span></p><p begin="01:29.852" end="01:41.090" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">抱き締めてくれた温かい手は遠くへ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经紧紧拥我在怀的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ki shi me te ku re ta</span></p><p begin="01:46.883" end="01:56.466" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">肩落とす僕にただ笑って寄り添って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我垂头丧气时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ta o to su bo ku ni ta da</span></p><p begin="01:58.084" end="02:03.972" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">それだけで歩き続けられた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仅仅如此 我就能继续前进</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re da ke de a ru ki tsu zu ke ra re ta</span></p><p begin="02:04.075" end="02:07.839" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">今さら気づいたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">事到如今我才发觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma sa ra ki zu i ta n da</span></p><p begin="02:09.667" end="02:20.039" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">まぶたを閉じると思い出す一人悩んでる横顔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">闭上眼睛 我就能回想起你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma bu ta wo to ji ru to o mo i da su</span></p><p begin="02:20.785" end="02:31.578" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">見つけてかける言葉は選べずに僕は逃げてた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我明明发现了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi tsu ke te ka ke ru</span></p><p begin="02:31.578" end="02:41.237" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">声をかけても届かなくて霞んでゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使发出声音 也无法传达 逐渐变得模糊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko e wo ka ke te mo to do ka na ku te ka su n de yu ku</span></p><p begin="02:41.328" end="02:42.306" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">ねえ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne e</span></p><p begin="02:42.391" end="02:49.537" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">聞き慣れたはずの君の声どこ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">早已习惯了你的声音 可现在却在哪里？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ki na re ta ha zu no ki mi no ko e do ko</span></p><p begin="02:49.717" end="02:55.911" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">忘れたくない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想忘记</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa su re ta ku na i</span></p><p begin="03:04.050" end="03:12.808" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">聞かせて耳元で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我听见啊 在我的耳边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ka se te mi mi mo to de</span></p><p begin="03:16.421" end="03:22.190" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">あの頃の僕は今より幼く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那时的我比现在更加不成熟</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no ko ro no bo ku wa i ma yo ri o sa na ku</span></p><p begin="03:22.191" end="03:24.620" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">"I want you to hear my voice."<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我希望你能听见我的声音</span></p><p begin="03:25.009" end="03:27.391" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">答えられず<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">得不到回答</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ta e ra re zu</span></p><p begin="03:27.594" end="03:33.278" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">今なら隣で同じ目線で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">事到如今 在你身旁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma na ra to na ri de o na ji me se n de</span></p><p begin="03:33.368" end="03:38.709" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">逃げないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不会再用相同的视线逃避</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni ge na i ka ra</span></p><p begin="03:44.126" end="03:53.687" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">手を伸ばしても届かなくて霞んでゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使伸出手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te wo no ba shi te mo</span></p><p begin="03:54.939" end="04:07.426" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">ほどけた糸は空高く昇って消えてく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">松开的线 升向高高的天空 渐渐消失</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho do ke ta i to wa so ra ta ka ku no bo 't te ki e te ku</span></p><p begin="04:09.195" end="04:18.901" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">手を伸ばしても届かない霞む空へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使伸出手 也无法够到 逐渐变得模糊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te wo no ba shi te mo to do ka na i ka su mu so ra he</span></p><p begin="04:19.017" end="04:20.067" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">Believe<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相信</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa su re na i ki mi wa ko re ka ra mo zu 't to</span></p><p begin="04:20.099" end="04:27.156" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">忘れない君はこれからもずっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不会忘记你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa su re na i ki mi wa ko re ka ra mo zu 't to</span></p><p begin="04:27.437" end="04:36.563" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">心に生きるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你会一直在我心中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro ni i ki ru yo</span></p><p begin="04:41.667" end="04:47.524" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">誓うよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我发誓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi ka u yo</span></p></div></body></tt>